    "rating": 4.8,
    "reference": "ChIJUfPJeLQ3yUwRvUbP3N5El_M",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Maxime Delagneau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102664023174207959943/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNKVs_9zixGu09uj97IFHHLe8nrR6EdzhbsrdH35RbMrxPCVwcIA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "BTT Canada Vaudreuil is the real deal. High-level jiu-jitsu, legit coaching, and zero BS. The instruction is sharp, the details matter, and you’re constantly pushed to level up.\nThe vibe is what makes it special: hard training, no egos, no weirdness. Just people who want to get better and aren’t afraid of tough rounds. You feel welcomed, then you get worked, exactly how it should be.\nClean gym, strong team, serious culture. If you want comfortable training, look elsewhere. If you want to actually improve, this is the spot.",
        "time": 1768573172,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Oliver Brière",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108186885914623633855/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOawCgO6T39d7TW7dMDA6FYXw7I61EwQaDilnpTTUFrCJ45Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Great place to exercise! Amazing teachers for kids, teens and adults. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1768326517,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gabriela Cruceanu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118225130170849572795/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEWCl3AuqTP15U3FO7YqjDH__TwBP-UE9PJwUbowTGc_tCdZUcLg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Family oriented, very clean, very flexible schedule in 2 locations, great teachers with lot of experience, competitive, close to route 40, huge parking lot.\nIt keeps you fit, healthy and ready for anything. It works all your muscles, joins, bones and sharp mind. They easily adapt to your stile of training and your personal needs.\nFree trial classes available too...It is a must try !",
        "time": 1565357765,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Franco Dominguez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102576209052152007331/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkW_yt4gby_MfyNAslF_iHJF5CId1a41naHIk1eKAHTVFjwsgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Best Jiu Jitsu place around Montreal, it's unbelievable the speed at which u learn. The instructors are patient and it's the best martial art for self defense.\n\nThey also make killers in the kids program.",
        "time": 1599784509,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Meaningless Abyss",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118388744490479536454/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXq5Mr3WTAGMSYl5Vp0pX4FgRi8nrzjKTxHtP48MKDYy3rtpm0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "No jiu-jitsu is worth 200 dollars per month... you can easily find jiu-jitsu places for half the price that allow for more classes and opportunities to learn additional martial arts. Save your money, go someplace else.",
        "time": 1614439581,
